    "updated_at": "2025-01-29T01:55:44Z",
    "body": "Alright, thanks for explaining. It sounds like we have a few options:\n\n- Revert https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10737 entirely. Sad, not fun.\n- Patch up the spec by removing the broken assert and fixing any other issues that are caused by the new setup. Complicated, unclear.\n- The minimal change in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10954.\n- The more maximal fix in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10124, and/or some other more maximal fix for https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5802.\n\nAssuming other implementers are OK with it, I'm happy with trying to move forward and applying one of the fixes. I'd appreciate a summary of the delta between #10954 and #10124 / the proposals in #5802 though, to know what the future evolution might look like.",
