    "body": "> to know what the future evolution might look like.\n\n#10954 is/can effectively be a subset; that is to say I believe it is entirely plausible for us to merge #10954 and follow up with #10124. I believe #10954 (or at least something like it) is _necessary_, and #10124 just adds extra steps that aren't in conflict.  ",
